  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "[yt-dlp 2026.02.04](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/tag/2026.02.04) has changed the default YouTube JS player variant to `tv`, to solve YouTube's n/sig challenges for video downloads (YouTube video playback in VRChat).\n\nVRChat's current yt-dlp version is 2026.01.29 at the time of writing this. This may be causing playback issues or triggering YouTube's bot protection for some users, such as \"Sign in to confirm you're not a bot\".\n\n```\n\nPS C:\\Users\\linda.LINDALAP\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools> .\\yt-dlp.exe --version\n\n2026.01.29\n\n```\n\nFull upstream changelogs diff between VRChat's yt-dlp and upstream yt-dlp are there:\n\n- [yt-dlp 2026.02.04](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/tag/2026.02.04)\n\n- [yt-dlp 2026.01.31](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/tag/2026.01.31)\n\nI recommend updating to the latest yt-dlp version.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/again-the-video-players-are-not-working-how-fun",
